{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "description": "container.clickSlot({slot,button?,mode?})。协议 1.10 的真实菜单点击原语。slot 使用 getGuiState.slots[].index；不依赖 GUI 坐标或窗口焦点。evidence=client_snapshot 只表示客户端已执行并回读，不代表服务端已确认。",
  "properties": {
    "slot": {
      "maximum": 511,
      "minimum": 0,
      "title": "Menu slot index",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "button": {
      "default": 0,
      "maximum": 40,
      "minimum": 0,
      "title": "Button",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "mode": {
      "default": "pickup",
      "enum": [
        "pickup",
        "quick_move",
        "swap",
        "clone",
        "throw",
        "quick_craft",
        "pickup_all"
      ],
      "title": "Click mode",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "slot"
  ],
  "title": "ContainerClickSlotParams",
  "type": "object"
}
